      "content": "An effect of the rapid acceleration of AI is we are losing an empirical handle on what is happening in the actual micro-processes of work in the post-2026 long-running agentic era.\n\nWe have academic knowledge of the impact of chatbots on work, much less on impacts of agents that can work for hours",
